      "id": "claim_9db9e8c6b20a4002aa6db119d3328e13",
      "statement": "packages/core/src/interview/ is chrysalyst's first domain logic and the first real caller of the ports; the package entry point now adds `export * from './interview/index.ts'` beside the type-only port re-export, so importing @chrysalyst/core emits the interview's runtime bindings while still opening no socket, file, or clock.",
      "evidence": [
