    {
      "id": "claim_f0375400f2204d6c96e015abc8da2156",
      "statement": "The map guarding in-flight productions is a closure variable and therefore process-local: one process reaches the model once per session, but two processes over one session directory can still produce two questions; endProduction calls forget() the instant the save resolves, and which production a caller belongs to is decided on its first pull against a freshly loaded (and language-resolved) session.",
